// A tall cave: a ladder of ledges past a rising ember, a shelf, a pit with a stone and an ember; the bloom bridges to the door.
name Ashfall
rule B1234/S012345678
steps 3
hint Climb the ledges; the seed lies on one of them, and an ember rises and falls between them. On the shelf above, a pit with a stone and another ember. Plant, climb out, stand back, Grow.
tip Three generations of bloom from the pit rise two cells above the shelf. Jump onto the bloom from the shelf's edge and walk right along its top to the door.
intro The cave climbs. Ledge by ledge, with an ember rising and falling in the dark between them. Somewhere above: a shelf, a pit, and a stone.
outro You climbed through the dark and grew a bridge at the top of it. The way down is behind you now.
